# NOTE: config.json is deliberately NOT ignored. The runtime stage copies it to
# /root/.aws-batch/config.json, which is where endgame_aws's Config finds the
# bucket name. Without it every job dies at startup on FileNotFoundError.

# NOTE: models/ is deliberately NOT ignored either, despite being *.json. The
# batch manifest is derived from those configs at runtime, so they are what
# tells the array job how many children to run and which model each one is.
